OL,3,GNEWSABBL practitioner 'unbothered' when
OL,4,Awoman collapsed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who carried out a cosmetic
OL,7,Fprocedure which an expert said led to a
OL,8,Fwoman's death seemed "unbothered" when
OL,9,Fparamedics arrived to help her, an
OL,10,Finquest has heard.
OL,12,FMother-of-five Alice Webb, 33,
OL,13,Fcollapsed at a friend's house in
OL,14,FGloucester on 23 September 2024 and
OL,15,Fdied the following day after having a
OL,16,FBrazilian Butt Lift (BBL).
OL,18,FJordan Parke, who police said they had
OL,19,F"no doubt" carried out the procedure,
OL,20,Fwas under investigation for gross
OL,21,Fnegligence manslaughter when he died in
OL,22,F2026.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
