OL,3,GNEWSABBL practitioner 'unbothered' when
OL,4,Awoman collapsed
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier an expert pathologist told the
OL,7,Finquest, which is taking place in front
OL,8,Fof a jury at Gloucestershire Coroner's
OL,9,FCourt, that a "gel-like" liquid was
OL,10,Ffound in blood vessels in Webb's brain,
OL,11,Flungs, and heart.
